@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
 #   46.105.253.72		WireGuard		additional, ens3
 #   				WG, proxy outbound
 #   192.168.204.0/24		WireGuard peers		wg0
-#   172.31.1.0/24		WireGuard S2S transit	wg1 (home-inet), wg2 (jennie)
+#   172.31.1.0/24		WireGuard S2S transit	wg1 (home), wg2 (jennie)
 #   fd33:5692:1834::/48		VPN ULA			all wg*
